---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Wave from '../components/Wave.astro';
import { guides } from '../data/guides';
import downloads from '../data/downloads.json';
---
<Base title="Audacity 中文下载与使用教程｜录音、剪辑、降噪指南" description="Audacity 中文指南：选择 Windows 安装版或便携版，核对官方下载来源，学习麦克风录音、电脑内录、音频剪辑、降噪和 MP3 导出。">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><span class="badge">免费开源音频软件 · 独立中文指南</span><h1>把你的声音，<br /><em>好好录下来。</em></h1><p class="lead">从安装 Audacity，到录音、剪辑和导出。<br />把复杂的选项，变成能跟着完成的中文步骤。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/download/">下载 Audacity <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/guides/record-voice/">开始第一次录音 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="fine hero-note"><span>软件免费</span><span>核对官方来源</span><span>中文操作指南</span></p></div><div><div class="studio" role="img" aria-label="音频编辑工作流示意：人声与配乐两条波形，不是 Audacity 实际界面截图"><div class="studio-head"><span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>我的第一段录音</span><span>WAV</span></div><div class="studio-tools"><span>◀</span><span>▶</span><span>■</span><span class="record-dot"></span><span>00 : 00 : 12</span></div><div class="timeline"><div class="timeline-scale"><span>0:00</span><span>0:05</span><span>0:10</span><span>0:15</span><span>0:20</span></div><div class="track"><div class="track-label"><span>01 · 人声</span><span>MONO</span></div><Wave /></div><div class="track orange"><div class="track-label"><span>02 · 配乐</span><span>STEREO</span></div><Wave orange /></div></div><div class="studio-caption"><span>录音 → 剪辑 → 导出</span><span>工作流示意</span></div></div><div class="mini-card"><b>✓</b><span>保留工程，也留下一份成品。</span></div></div></div></section>
  <div class="trust-bar"><div class="container trust-inner"><div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">↓</span><span>下载前先选对版本<small>x64 / ARM64 / 便携版</small></span></div><div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">≋</span><span>围绕实际任务来学<small>录音、剪辑、降噪、导出</small></span></div><div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">↗</span><span>每篇都附资料来源<small>遇到变化可核对官方帮助</small></span></div></div></div>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">START WITH A TASK</span><h2>你想先完成哪件事？</h2><p>不用先记住所有菜单，从手头的一段声音开始。</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/guides/">全部 {guides.length} 篇教程 →</a></div><div class="cards">{guides.slice(1,7).map((g,i) => <a class="card" href={`/guides/${g.slug}/`}><div class="card-num"><span>0{i+1} / {g.category}</span><span>↗</span></div><h3>{g.short}</h3><p>{g.intro}</p><div class="card-bottom"><span>约 {g.minutes} 分钟阅读</span><span>→</span></div></a>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST PROJECT</span><h2>第一段录音，分三步完成</h2></div></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><strong>01 / 准备</strong><h3>下载，再检查设备</h3><p>按电脑架构选择安装包。连接麦克风，确认录音和播放设备，先做一次短录音。</p><a class="text-link" href="/guides/install/">查看安装说明 →</a></div><div class="step"><strong>02 / 编辑</strong><h3>留下你想保留的声音</h3><p>听完录音，再删除多余的停顿。噪声需要轻量处理，避免把人声一起削掉。</p><a class="text-link" href="/guides/edit-audio/">学习剪切与拼接 →</a></div><div class="step"><strong>03 / 分享</strong><h3>保存工程，导出音频</h3><p>工程便于以后继续修改；MP3、WAV 等音频文件用于播放和分享。导出后记得回放检查。</p><a class="text-link" href="/guides/export-audio/">了解导出格式 →</a></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="callout"><div><h2>准备开始了？</h2><p>下载中心已整理 Audacity {downloads.version} 的 Windows 版本、来源与校验值。</p></div><a class="button" href="/download/">选择我的版本 →</a></div></div></section>
</Base>
